          "description": "This free digital card was made by an Independent Creator and published on Yoto Space. Visit Open Mic on Yoto Space to discover more great free titles!  \n\nCreator: The Blood Harmonies  \n\nFrom the Creator:   “Wild and Free is a hopeful cinematic duet that captures the spirit of living life to the fullest.   It showcases the unique sibling vocals of \"The Blood Harmonies\" with a lilting intricate melody and complex harmony.   It is written from the perspective of parents to a child encourage them to embrace their individuality, enjoy the world around them, and reinforces the idea that they are worth the time and effort it takes to raise them.”   \n\nFor ages: All ages\nFeatured on Discover until 31st March \nStays in your library and available on Yoto Space at any time",
